ISO-10303-21;
/* Tfa051: CLOSED_SHELL: face[0] is 10×10 ADVANCED_FACE on B_SPLINE_SURFACE_WITH_KNOTS (degree=2 in U, knots=[0,0.5,1], U-mults=[3,2,3]); internal U-multiplicity=2=degree at U=0.5 creates C0 crease (tangent discontinuity); surface is geometrically flat but parameterically C0-kinked at U=0.5; ShapeUpgrade_FaceDivide::Perform must split face[0] into two sub-faces at U=0.5; downstream meshers need smaller pieces; Booleans avoid C0 line; face[1..5] are plane faces forming closed 10×10×1 box; defect IS on live CLOSED_SHELL traversal path */
